{"seq":2,"slug":"monorepo-build-strategies","title":"Monorepo 构建策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/pipeline-and-devops/monorepo-build-strategies","wordCount":729,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"monorepo-构建策略\">Monorepo 构建策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Monorepo 的构建难点不在「怎么构建单个包」，而在「怎么只构建该构建的包」。这引出三个核心问题：变更影响分析（哪些包因本次改动需要重建）、任务图拓扑排序（包间的依赖顺序）、以及跨包缓存复用（未变化的包直接命中缓存）。Turborepo 与 Nx 是应对这类问题的两类任务编排引擎——前者轻量、以哈希缓存为核心，后者功能更全、覆盖任务图与依赖图分析。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo-的构建挑战\">Monorepo 的构建挑战</h2><p>Monorepo（单一代码仓库）将多个相关项目放在一个仓库中管理。这种方式简化了代码共享和依赖管理，但也带来了独特的构建挑战：如何只构建变更的包？如何处理包间依赖的构建顺序？如何在 CI 中高效地编排构建任务？</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Monorepo 结构&#10;        ROOT[根目录]&#10;        APP_WEB[apps/web&lt;br/&gt;前端应用]&#10;        APP_ADMIN[apps/admin&lt;br/&gt;管理后台]&#10;        PKG_UI[packages/ui&lt;br/&gt;UI 组件库]&#10;        PKG_UTILS[packages/utils&lt;br/&gt;工具库]&#10;        PKG_CONFIG[packages/config&lt;br/&gt;共享配置]&#10;    end&#10;    ROOT --&gt; APP_WEB&#10;    ROOT --&gt; APP_ADMIN&#10;    ROOT --&gt; PKG_UI&#10;    ROOT --&gt; PKG_UTILS&#10;    ROOT --&gt; PKG_CONFIG&#10;    APP_WEB --&gt; PKG_UI&#10;    APP_WEB --&gt; PKG_UTILS&#10;    APP_ADMIN --&gt; PKG_UI&#10;    APP_ADMIN --&gt; PKG_UTILS&#10;    PKG_UI --&gt; PKG_UTILS&#10;    PKG_UI --&gt; PKG_CONFIG&#10;    PKG_UTILS --&gt; PKG_CONFIG\">graph TD\n    subgraph Monorepo 结构\n        ROOT[根目录]\n        APP_WEB[apps/web&lt;br/&gt;前端应用]\n        APP_ADMIN[apps/admin&lt;br/&gt;管理后台]\n        PKG_UI[packages/ui&lt;br/&gt;UI 组件库]\n        PKG_UTILS[packages/utils&lt;br/&gt;工具库]\n        PKG_CONFIG[packages/config&lt;br/&gt;共享配置]\n    end\n    ROOT --&gt; APP_WEB\n    ROOT --&gt; APP_ADMIN\n    ROOT --&gt; PKG_UI\n    ROOT --&gt; PKG_UTILS\n    ROOT --&gt; PKG_CONFIG\n    APP_WEB --&gt; PKG_UI\n    APP_WEB --&gt; PKG_UTILS\n    APP_ADMIN --&gt; PKG_UI\n    APP_ADMIN --&gt; PKG_UTILS\n    PKG_UI --&gt; PKG_UTILS\n    PKG_UI --&gt; PKG_CONFIG\n    PKG_UTILS --&gt; PKG_CONFIG</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"包管理器的-workspace-支持\">包管理器的 Workspace 支持</h2><h3 id=\"pnpm-workspace\">pnpm Workspace</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# pnpm-workspace.yaml&#10;packages:&#10;  - &#39;apps/*&#39;&#10;  - &#39;packages/*&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># pnpm-workspace.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'apps/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'packages/*'</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/web&quot;,&#10;  &quot;dependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;@myorg/ui&quot;: &quot;workspace:*&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@myorg/utils&quot;: &quot;workspace:*&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/web\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"dependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:*\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>pnpm Workspace 确保了包之间的依赖链接是通过符号链接（symlink）实现的，本地修改即时生效，无需发布。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"turborepo-任务编排引擎\">Turborepo：任务编排引擎</h2><p>Turborepo 是 Vercel 开发的 Monorepo 构建工具，专注于<strong>任务编排</strong>和<strong>缓存</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph Turborepo 任务图&#10;        UTILS_BUILD[utils#build]&#10;        CONFIG_BUILD[config#build]&#10;        UI_BUILD[ui#build]&#10;        WEB_BUILD[web#build]&#10;        ADMIN_BUILD[admin#build]&#10;    end&#10;    CONFIG_BUILD --&gt; UTILS_BUILD&#10;    CONFIG_BUILD --&gt; UI_BUILD&#10;    UTILS_BUILD --&gt; UI_BUILD&#10;    UI_BUILD --&gt; WEB_BUILD&#10;    UI_BUILD --&gt; ADMIN_BUILD&#10;    UTILS_BUILD --&gt; WEB_BUILD&#10;    UTILS_BUILD --&gt; ADMIN_BUILD\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph Turborepo 任务图\n        UTILS_BUILD[utils#build]\n        CONFIG_BUILD[config#build]\n        UI_BUILD[ui#build]\n        WEB_BUILD[web#build]\n        ADMIN_BUILD[admin#build]\n    end\n    CONFIG_BUILD --&gt; UTILS_BUILD\n    CONFIG_BUILD --&gt; UI_BUILD\n    UTILS_BUILD --&gt; UI_BUILD\n    UI_BUILD --&gt; WEB_BUILD\n    UI_BUILD --&gt; ADMIN_BUILD\n    UTILS_BUILD --&gt; WEB_BUILD\n    UTILS_BUILD --&gt; ADMIN_BUILD</pre><p>Turborepo 根据包之间的依赖关系自动构建任务图（Task Graph），确保依赖先于消费者构建，并尽可能并行执行独立任务。</p>\n<h3 id=\"配置\">配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://turbo.build/schema.json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tasks&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;dist/**&quot;, &quot;.next/**&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;test&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;src/**&quot;, &quot;test/**&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;lint&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;typecheck&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;dev&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: false,&#10;      &quot;persistent&quot;: true&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://turbo.build/schema.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".next/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"test/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"typecheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dev\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"persistent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置项</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>dependsOn</code></td>\n<td>任务依赖，<code>^build</code> 表示先构建所有上游依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>outputs</code></td>\n<td>任务输出目录，用于缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>inputs</code></td>\n<td>任务输入文件，用于计算缓存键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cache</code></td>\n<td>是否启用缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>persistent</code></td>\n<td>是否为长运行任务（如 dev server）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"命令使用\">命令使用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 构建所有包&#10;turbo build&#10;&#10;# 只构建特定包及其依赖&#10;turbo build --filter=@myorg/web&#10;&#10;# 只构建变更的包&#10;turbo build --filter=...[HEAD^1]&#10;&#10;# 并行运行开发服务器&#10;turbo dev --filter=@myorg/web --filter=@myorg/admin\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 构建所有包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只构建特定包及其依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter=@myorg/web</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只构建变更的包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter=...[HEAD^1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 并行运行开发服务器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter=@myorg/web</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter=@myorg/admin</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"过滤语法\">过滤语法</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>--filter=web</code></td>\n<td>只运行 web 包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--filter=web...</code></td>\n<td>web 及其所有依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--filter=...web</code></td>\n<td>web 及其所有消费者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--filter=...[HEAD^1]</code></td>\n<td>自上次提交以来变更的包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--filter=@myorg/*</code></td>\n<td>匹配 @myorg 下所有包</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"nx-全功能-monorepo-平台\">Nx：全功能 Monorepo 平台</h2><p>Nx 是另一个成熟的 Monorepo 构建工具，功能比 Turborepo 更加全面：</p>\n<h3 id=\"nx-配置\">Nx 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;targetDefaults&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;production&quot;, &quot;^production&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;{projectRoot}/dist&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;test&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;default&quot;, &quot;^production&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;lint&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;default&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;namedInputs&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;default&quot;: [&quot;{projectRoot}/**/*&quot;, &quot;sharedGlobals&quot;],&#10;    &quot;production&quot;: [&quot;default&quot;, &quot;!{projectRoot}/**/*.spec.ts&quot;, &quot;!{projectRoot}/tsconfig.spec.json&quot;],&#10;    &quot;sharedGlobals&quot;: [&quot;{workspaceRoot}/tsconfig.base.json&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"targetDefaults\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{projectRoot}/dist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"namedInputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dar